# Vercel deployment ignore list for the 4weird static site.
# Secret-bearing and machine-local files must never reach the CDN, even if
# they sit inside the published directory (e.g. website/v1/ai/mediamogul/.env
# holds live API keys). Service config reference:
# https://vercel.com/docs/projects/project-configuration#vercelignore
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
secrets.json
**/.vibecodeworker-user-data/
.vibecodeworker-user-data/
